      "writtenOn": "2021-11-29T21:13:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I should probably rephrase some of that. fontmgr_custom_* do depend on :typeface_freetype, but only indirectly (through public headers of fontmgr_custom and of course transitively at runtime through the implementation of fontmgr_custom). However, in theory the implementation of fontmgr_custom could change to depend on something other than :typeface_freetype and fontmgr_custom_* should continue to compile and work.\n\nThat is to say, what we currently state in gn is more or less exactly what we wanted to state here (as far as fontmgr_custom is concerned, this code of course also depends on core Skia and should also be getting its Skia headers from depending on some :skia_core target and not by implicitly having the sources just pick up the right headers by just magically making them available.",
